      "content": "hey, im seeing something weird and i can't figure it out. i keep seeing the same dude in a red jacket in totally different parts of the city, like within ten minutes of each other, even though it's impossible for him to have traveled that fast. and then today i heard a lady say \"the clock is resetting\" out of nowhere. it feels like... i dont know, like the world is lagging or something. do u ever notice any weird inconsistencies in the way things happen? like glitches?",
